# AUDIT CONTEXT

This system requires FULL TRACEABILITY.

## EVERYTHING MUST BE LOGGED

- Document uploads
- Version creation
- Status changes
- Approvals
- User actions

## AUDIT TABLE

AuditLog:
- id
- userId
- action
- entityType
- entityId
- timestamp
- metadata (JSON)

## RULE

If an action is important, it MUST be logged.

No exceptions.